   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><b><a id="toc" title="toc" href="#"></a>The LGL Group, Inc.</b></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><b>Form 10-Q for the Period Ended&#160;June 30, 2026</b></p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>Table of Contents</b></p>
