   </ix:exclude>
   <ix:exclude></ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;"><i><b></b></i></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:CashAndCashEquivalentsRestrictedCashAndCashEquivalentsPolicy" id="c149864395" escape="true"><p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;"><i><b>Cash and Cash Equivalents and Restricted Cash and Cash Equivalents</b></i></p>
   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Cash and cash equivalents consist of cash on hand and&#160;highly liquid investments with&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">no</em>&#160;maturity or with a maturity of less than&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">three</em>&#160;months when purchased.</p>
   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Restricted cash and cash equivalents primarily consist of funds received from rights holders electing to exercise their subscription rights as part of the Company's rights offering, held in a separate account designated solely for this purpose as of <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026, </em>pending completion of the rights offering. These funds were <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> available for the Company's general use until the rights offering closed. Subsequent to quarter end, the funds were transferred to the subscription agent&#160;and the Company received the aggregate offering proceeds upon closing of the rights offering on <em style="font: inherit;"> July 24, 2026.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 3pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The following table provides a reconciliation of cash and cash equivalents and restricted cash and cash equivalents reported in our Condensed Consolidated Balance Sheet to the total shown in our Condensed Consolidated Statement of Cash Flows:</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfCashAndCashEquivalentsTableTextBlock" id="c3264162" escape="true">
     <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="finTable" style="width: 100%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; text-indent: 0px;"><tbody><tr class="finHeading" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td colspan="3" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;"><em style="font: inherit;">June 30, 2026</em></em></b></p> </td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td colspan="3" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0pt;"><b><em style="font: inherit;"><em style="font: inherit;">December 31, 2025</em></em></b></p> </td></tr>
<tr style="background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; width: 66%;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Cash and cash equivalents</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;">$</td><td style="width: 14%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction id="c149858038" contextRef="i_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:CashAndCashEquivalentsAtCarryingValue" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">45,115</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><em style="font: inherit;">&#160;</em></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;">$</td><td style="width: 14%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction id="c149858040" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:CashAndCashEquivalentsAtCarryingValue" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">41,514</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><em style="font: inherit;">&#160;</em></td></tr>
<tr style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">Restricted cash and cash equivalents</p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td><td style="width: 14%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ix:nonFraction id="c149858042" contextRef="i_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestrictedCashAndCashEquivalents" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-4">320</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0pt;"><em style="font: inherit;">&#160;</em></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);">&#160;</td><td style="width: 14%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: right;"><ix:nonFraction id="c149858044" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestrictedCashAndCashEquivalents" scale="3" format="ixt:fixed-zero" decimals="-3">&#8212;</ix:nonFraction></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0pt;"><em style="font: inherit;">&#160;</em></td></tr>
<tr style="background-color: rgb(204, 238, 255); vertical-align: bottom"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;"><b>Total cash and cash equivalents and restricted cash and cash equivalents shown in the statements of cash flows</b></p> </td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 14%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><ix:nonFraction id="c149858046" contextRef="i_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:CashCashEquivalentsRestrictedCashAndRestrictedCashEquivalentsIncludingDisposalGroupAndDiscontinuedOperations" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">45,435</ix:nonFraction></b></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0pt;"><em style="font: inherit;">&#160;</em></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);">$</td><td style="width: 14%; text-align: right; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><ix:nonFraction id="c149858048" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:CashCashEquivalentsRestrictedCashAndRestrictedCashEquivalentsIncludingDisposalGroupAndDiscontinuedOperations" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">41,514</ix:nonFraction></b></td><td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; border-bottom: 3px double rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-left: 0pt;"><em style="font: inherit;">&#160;</em></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
    </ix:nonNumeric>
   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; margin: 0pt;"></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i><b></b></i></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:DebtPolicyTextBlock" id="c149864396" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i><b>Convertible Promissory Note</b></i></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The convertible promissory note held by Skyline SPV (the "Skyline Note") is measured at fair value due to the election of the fair value option. The election was made to reflect the Skyline Note at its current economic value each reporting period, including the value of the embedded conversion feature, without requiring separate accounting for the conversion feature as an embedded derivative.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The Skyline Note is classified as a non-current asset on the Condensed Consolidated Balance Sheet.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Refer to Note <em style="font: inherit;">4</em> - Investments and Note <em style="font: inherit;">5</em> - Fair Value Measurements for further information.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;"><i><b></b></i></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:FairValueMeasurementPolicyPolicyTextBlock" id="c149864397" escape="true"><p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;"><i><b>Fair Value Option</b></i></p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">Under the fair value option, the Company <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>elect to measure at fair value financial assets and financial liabilities that are <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> otherwise required to be carried at fair value. The Company elected the fair value option for the Skyline Note upon purchase&#160;because it better reflects the economics of a convertible instrument.&#160;This election is irrevocable.</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">Subsequent changes in fair value are reported Net gains (losses) on the Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations. Interest income on assets measured under the fair value option is recognized and included in Net investment income in the Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations.</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">Refer to Note <em style="font: inherit;">4</em> - Investments and Note <em style="font: inherit;">5</em> - Fair Value Measurements for further information.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><i></i></b></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskCreditRisk" id="c149864398" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b><i>Concentration Risks</i></b></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><i>Customer Concentrations</i></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">For the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c149860342" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" unitRef="Pure" name="lgl:NumberOfCustomers" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF">two</ix:nonFraction> customers each accounted for <em style="font: inherit;">10%</em> or more of the Company's Net sales, representing $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860344" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-LargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-4">490</ix:nonFraction>, or&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c149860345" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-LargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">65.3</ix:nonFraction>%, and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860346" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-SecondLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">100</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860347" contextRef="d_2026-04-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-SecondLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">13.3</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively. For the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2025</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c149860349" contextRef="i_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" unitRef="Pure" name="lgl:NumberOfCustomers" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF">four</ix:nonFraction> customers each accounted for <em style="font: inherit;">10%</em> or more of the Company's Net sales, representing $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860351" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-LargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">157</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860352" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-LargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">32.0</ix:nonFraction>%; $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860353" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-SecondLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">108</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860354" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-SecondLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">22.0</ix:nonFraction>%; $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860355" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-ThirdLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">77</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860356" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-ThirdLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">15.7</ix:nonFraction>%;&#160;and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860357" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-FourthLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">51</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860358" contextRef="d_2025-04-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-FourthLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">10.4</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">For the <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c149860360" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" unitRef="Pure" name="lgl:NumberOfCustomers" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF">two</ix:nonFraction> customers each accounted for <em style="font: inherit;">10%</em> or more of the Company's Net sales, representing $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860362" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-LargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">815</ix:nonFraction>, or&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c149860363" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-LargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">56.9</ix:nonFraction>%, and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860364" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-SecondLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">273</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860365" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-SecondLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">19.1</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively. For the <em style="font: inherit;">six</em> months ended <em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2025</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c149860367" contextRef="i_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" unitRef="Pure" name="lgl:NumberOfCustomers" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF">four</ix:nonFraction> customers each accounted for <em style="font: inherit;">10%</em> or more of the Company's Net sales, representing $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860369" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-LargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">181</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860370" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-LargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">18.3</ix:nonFraction>%; $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860371" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-SecondLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">109</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860372" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-SecondLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">11.0</ix:nonFraction>%; $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860373" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-ThirdLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">108</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860374" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-ThirdLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">10.9</ix:nonFraction>%;&#160;and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860375" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-FourthLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">100</ix:nonFraction>, or <ix:nonFraction id="c149860376" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-RevenueFromContractWithCustomerMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-FourthLargestCustomerMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="3">10.1</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively.</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Customers exceeding <em style="font: inherit;">10%</em> of Net sales are identified separately for each period presented. A customer that exceeded the threshold in <em style="font: inherit;">one</em> period was <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> necessarily the same customer, or a <em style="font: inherit;">10%</em> customer at all, in any other period presented, including as between the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em>-month and <em style="font: inherit;">six</em>-month periods.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><i>Credit Concentration</i></p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">A significant portion of the Company's accounts receivable is concentrated with a relatively small number of customers. As of&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c149860383" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-AccountsReceivableMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" unitRef="Pure" name="lgl:NumberOfCustomers" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF">two</ix:nonFraction>&#160;of the&#160;Company's&#160;customers accounted for approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860384" contextRef="i_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-AccountsReceivableMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-TwoLargestCustomersMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNet" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">466</ix:nonFraction>, or&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c149860385" contextRef="d_2026-01-01_2026-06-30_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-AccountsReceivableMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-TwoLargestCustomersMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">79.0</ix:nonFraction>%, of gross accounts receivable. As of&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c149860386" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-AccountsReceivableMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember" unitRef="Pure" name="lgl:NumberOfCustomers" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF">four</ix:nonFraction>&#160;of the Company's customers accounted for approximately $<ix:nonFraction id="c149860387" contextRef="i_2025-12-31_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-AccountsReceivableMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-FourLargestCustomersMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AccountsReceivableNet" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">412</ix:nonFraction>, or&#160;<ix:nonFraction id="c149860388" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-AccountsReceivableMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-FourLargestCustomersMember" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="2">66.0</ix:nonFraction>%, of gross accounts receivable. The Company carefully evaluates the creditworthiness of its customers in deciding to extend credit. As a result, the Company has historically experienced low credit losses and considers the risk to be minimal.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The Company maintains its cash and cash equivalents with high-credit-quality financial institutions, and at times cash balances on deposit <em style="font: inherit;"> may </em>exceed federally insured limits. A significant portion of the Company's cash and cash equivalents is invested in money market mutual funds. Amounts invested in money market mutual funds are <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> deposits, are <em style="font: inherit;">not</em> federally insured, and are subject to the credit and market risks of the underlying fund.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:exclude>
    <div class="PGFTR" style="text-align: center; width: 100%">
     <div class="hf-row">
      <div class="hf-cell PGNUM" style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman;">
       <em style="font: inherit;">8</em>
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
    <hr style="PAGE-BREAK-AFTER: always; border: none; width: 100%; height: 2px; color: #000000; background-color: #000000"/>
    <div class="PGHDR" style="width: 100%;">
     <div class="hf-row">
      <div class="hf-cell TOCLink" style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt; width: 99.9%; display: inline-block;">
       <a href="#toc" style="font-weight: initial; font-style: initial; font-variant: initial; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">Table of Contents</a>
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="hf-row">
      <div class="hf-cell" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; margin: 0pt; width: 99.9%; display: inline-block;">
        The LGL Group, Inc.
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="hf-row">
      <div class="hf-cell" style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left; font-weight: bold; margin: 0pt; width: 99.9%; display: inline-block;">
        Notes to the Condensed Consolidated Financial Statements (Unaudited)
      </div>
     </div>
     <div class="hf-row">
