   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i><b>Net Gains (Losses)</b></i></p> &#160;
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 1pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Net gains and losses are determined by specific identification. The net realized gains and losses are generated primarily from the following sources:</p>
