   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><i><b>Consolidated VIEs</b></i></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The Company's consolidated VIEs are&#160;LGL Systems and Skyline SPV.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 3pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The following table summarizes the assets and liabilities of the Company's consolidated VIEs&#160;included in the Condensed Consolidated Balance Sheets:</p>
