  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">Loss Before Income Taxes</span></p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">Loss before income taxes&#160;increased $265, or 107.3%, from&#160;$247&#160;for the&#160;three months ended June 30, 2025&#160;to&#160;$512&#160;for the three months ended June 30, 2026. The&#160;increase: was primarily due to&#160;a $258, or 61.7%,&#160;increase&#160;in Engineering, selling and administrative driven by higher stock-based compensation, higher salaries and wages and related benefits, and higher professional services fees.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt 0pt 6pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><i>Six&#160;months ended&#160;June 30, 2026&#160;compared to&#160;six months ended&#160;June 30, 2025</i></p>
