   <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">During the <em style="font: inherit;">three</em> months ended&#160;<em style="font: inherit;"> June 30, 2026</em>,&#160;<span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c149860629">none</span> of our directors or officers, as defined in Section <em style="font: inherit;">16</em> of the Exchange Act, adopted or terminated a "Rule <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c149860631">10b5</span>-<span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c149860632">1</span> trading arrangement" or a "non-Rule <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c149860633">10b5</span>-<em style="font: inherit;">1</em> trading arrangement," as each term is defined in Item <em style="font: inherit;">408</em> of Regulation S-K of the Exchange Act.</p>
  </ix:nonNumeric>
  <div>
   &#160;
  </div>
